  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade and Supply Chain Finance Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s investment in this Asian Development Bank program supports banks and micro, small and medium sized enterprises in developing countries and least developed countries in the Indo-Pacific to strengthen trade finance capacity and accessibility. It aims to help close the global trade finance gap by addressing information asymmetries and changing perceptions of risks in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
